  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> be a unit vector coplanar with <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and <math><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math> such that <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> is perpendicular to <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math>. If the projection of <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> along <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math> is equal to"
  },
